  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposal, by reason of the proposed garage use would fail to promote sustainable modes of transport due to the excessive car parking provision. Therefore, the proposal would be contrary to London Plan policy T6.1 and Local Plan policy EC2 (Developing a sustainable local transport network) and the Council's adopted Residential Crossover and Off-Street Parking Policy.",
    "Reason : 2 - The proposed outbuilding, by virtue of its excessive size would result in a bulky and incongruous addition to the site, which would harm the character and appearance of the site and surrounding area, contrary to adopted Local Plan policy CC1 (Context and Character), CC2 (Urban Design and Architecture), SC7 (Residential Extensions and Alterations), and the intent of the Character, Sustainability, Design Codes SPD."
